sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (stdin)
    participant D as Debugger
    participant K as Kernel
    participant T as Tracee

    Note over D,T: ── Phase 1: Attach ──
    D->>K: PtraceAttach(pid)
    K->>T: deliver SIGSTOP
    Note over T: Tracee STOPS
    Note over D: Debugger BLOCKED
    D->>K: wait4(pid) — blocks until tracee stops
    K-->>D: returns WaitStatus (stopped by SIGSTOP)
    Note over D: Debugger UNBLOCKED
    Note over T: Tracee remains STOPPED

    Note over D,T: ── Phase 2: REPL loop ──
    D->>U: print prompt "(toydbg) "
    Note over D: Debugger BLOCKED on readline
    Note over T: Tracee still STOPPED
    U-->>D: types "continue"
    Note over D: Debugger UNBLOCKED

    D->>K: PtraceCont(pid, 0)
    Note over T: Tracee RESUMES execution
    Note over D: Debugger BLOCKED
    D->>K: wait4(pid) — blocks until tracee stops
    Note over T: Tracee hits breakpoint / exits / gets signal
    Note over T: Tracee STOPS again
    K-->>D: returns WaitStatus
    Note over D: Debugger UNBLOCKED

    D->>U: print stop reason
    D->>U: print prompt "(toydbg) "
    Note over D: Debugger BLOCKED on readline again
    Note over T: Tracee STOPPED again
    Note over D,T: ── cycle repeats ──
